# GCP

## Mục tiêu

Google Cloud Platform (GCP) là cloud platform cung cấp services cho computing, data, AI, và enterprise applications với focus trên data analytics, machine learning, và container-native development. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, GCP được sử dụng cho organizations cần strong data/ML capabilities, Kubernetes-native development (GKE), hoặc BigQuery cho data warehousing.

## Nguyên tắc

**1. Resource Organization**

Projects. Folders. Organizations. Resource hierarchy. Naming conventions.

**2. Networking**

VPC networks. Subnets. Firewall rules. Cloud Router. VPN. Private Google Access.

**3. Compute**

Compute Engine. GKE. Cloud Run. App Engine. Kubernetes Engine.

**4. Storage**

Cloud Storage. Filestore. Persistent Disk. Bigtable.

**5. Data & Analytics**

BigQuery. Dataflow. Dataproc. Pub/Sub. BigQuery ML.

**6. AI & ML**

Vertex AI. AutoML. TensorFlow on GCP. AI Platform.

**7. Security**

IAM. Cloud KMS. Security Command Center. Binary Authorization.

**8. Monitoring**

Cloud Monitoring. Cloud Logging. Cloud Trace. Cloud Profiler.

